{
    rodeSnake: [
      'Word travels even out here: you RODE the serpent. The star-snake. People will be telling that one without your name in a year \u2014 make sure they keep the name.',
      'They say you rode the great serpent between worlds. I half-believed it until just now, looking at you. You have the look of someone the sky carried.'
    ],
    built: [
      'I saw what you raised out there. A traveler who BUILDS \u2014 that\u2019s rare. Most take shelter; you made some. The ground remembers that kind.',
      'You\u2019ve been building. Good. Anyone can pass through a world. Leaving it more standing than you found it \u2014 that\u2019s the other thing.'
    ],
    walkedChord: [
      'You\u2019ve walked the Long Chord itself \u2014 it\u2019s in how you stand, like the ground might breathe. Reedfolk stand that way. Consider it a compliment.',
      'So you\u2019ve set foot on the great structure. Few from the round worlds have. Did it sing? Don\u2019t answer. Keep it.'
    ]
  }

{
    high: ['Safe roads, friend. This door knows you now.', 'Go well. Come back before the season turns \u2014 that\u2019s not a request, it\u2019s a hope.', 'The fire\u2019s yours whenever you\u2019re near. That\u2019s as formal as we get.'],
    mid:  ['Walk well. The ground remembers footsteps longer than you\u2019d think.', 'Mind the weather and the borders, in that order.', 'Till the road bends you back this way.'],
    low:  ['That\u2019s all I\u2019ve got for you today.', 'The road\u2019s that way. It usually is.', 'We\u2019re done, I think. The well\u2019s public; the rest of my time isn\u2019t.']
  }

[
    { face:'SOUL',      text:'The Reedfolk line the river here. They do not fear you — every voice that enters the Chord is, to them, Coda returning.' },
    { face:'GAS',       text:'Coda, recovered: “I thought I was chasing a structure. It is chasing nothing. It only holds. Hold long enough and you stop being a traveler and become a note.”' },
    { face:'DNB',       text:'The Dissonant cross your Movement — voices that drifted out of harmony an age ago and call the search a sickness. Not wrong to be afraid. Only wrong to have stopped.' },
    { face:'GLITCHPOP', text:'The Bars come faster now, the Movements shorter. You near the center, where the note is held hardest.' }
  ]

